// An invented portal whose pages are generated by Liquid conditions, loops, includes, captures and platform
// components over data. Its pages are written on top of the example project's export (examples/project/portal) so
// that its lists, forms, table permissions and invented records are there for the components to render; its
// Solution metadata and records come from the same example project.
